      "extract": "\\label{preliminaries} There is no claim of originality in this section. Our sources are Lerman \\cite{lerman1}, Metzler \\cite{metzler}, Heinloth \\cite{heinloth} and Moerdijk-Mr\\v{c}un \\cite{moerdijk}. A slightly different but equivalent approach is developed in \\cite{murray5}.",
      "extractCut": false
