      "extract": "We assume that the reader is familiar with the notions of Lie groupoids, smooth functors and smooth natural transformations. \\begin{comment} \\textsf{}A \\emph{Lie category} is a small category $\\mathcal{C}$ whose sets $\\mathcal{C}_0$ of objects and $\\mathcal{C}_{1}$ morphisms are smooth manifolds, its target and source maps $t,s: \\mathcal{C}_1 \\to \\mathcal{C}_0$ are surjective submersions, the identity map $\\id:",
