      ],
      "extract": "We give the definition of a principal bundle in exactly the same way as we are going to define principal \\emph{2-}bundles in Section \\ref{sec:2bundle}. \\begin{definition} \\label{def:pgb} Let $M$ be a smooth manifold, and let $\\Gamma$ be a Lie groupoid. \\begin{enumerate} \\item A \\emph{principal $\\Gamma$-bundle over $M$} is a smooth manifold $P$ with a surjective submersion $\\pi: P \\to M$ and a right $\\Gamma$-action",
