      "extract": "\\label{versionI} We have already mentioned group valued \\v Cech 1-cocycles in the introduction. They consist of an open cover $\\mathscr{U} = \\{U_i\\}_{i\\in I}$ of $M$ and smooth functions $g_{ij}: U_i \\cap U_j \\to G$ satisfying the cocycle condition $ g_{ij} \\cdot g_{jk} = g_{ik}$. Segal realized \\cite{segal3} that this is the same as a smooth functor $$g: \\vC (\\mathscr{U}) \\to \\mathcal{B}G $$ where $\\mathcal{B} G $",
