      ],
      "extract": "\\label{versionIII} Several definitions of non-abelian bundle gerbes have appeared in literature so far \\cite{aschieri,jurco1,murray5}. The approach we give here not only shows a conceptually clear way to define non-abelian bundle gerbes, but also produces systematically a whole bicategory. Moreover, these bicategories form a 2-stack over smooth manifolds (with the Grothendieck topology of surjective submersions).",
      "extractCut": false
